OL,3,GNEWSASchool keep-clear sign painted
OL,4,Anext to empty field
OL,5,
OL,6,FYellow "school keep clear "markings
OL,7,Fhave been painted on a road in Sawtry,
OL,8,Fdespite no school building being there.
OL,10,FThe field off Glatton Road is earmarked
OL,11,Ffor a new primary school in the future,
OL,12,Fbut it is still awaiting full planning
OL,13,Fpermission.
OL,15,FSimon Bywater, the ward's Conservative
OL,16,Fdistrict and county councillor, said it
OL,17,Fhas "attracted considerable criticism
OL,18,Fand ridicule locally".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
