OL,3,GNEWSASchool keep-clear sign painted
OL,4,Anext to empty field
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire County Council said the
OL,7,Fmarkings were painted in error by
OL,8,Fcontractors acting on behalf of the
OL,9,Fdeveloper, which is planning to build
OL,10,Fthe houses.
